over on GoTo Malta's new short explainer video. Need a voiceover style similar to this? Find out more!\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container page-header-nav-wrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-content","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"GoTo Malta Explainer Video"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>A clever angle on the classic short explainer video</p>\r\n"}}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-arrows","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/hotels-dot-com-what-else-could-go-wrong-voiceover","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"Natural Voiceover for Hotels.com","aria-label":"Previous: Natural Voiceover for Hotels.com","children":"‹"}],["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/manchester-city-football-commentry-voice","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"Manchester City Football Commentator","aria-label":"Next: Manchester City Football Commentator","children":"›"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Working with GoTo Malta</h2>\r\n<p>This is a really fun idea for an explainer video! I knew it was a good project for me as soon as I read the script and it was easy to find the right tone of voice for the animation. With computer games more or less taking over the world, why not explain your bike, scooter, and car rental service in terms of video games? This video will obviously chime with younger audiences and the cute pixel art style will help GoTo Malta stand out from their competitors. Check out some of my other <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer videos</a> if you'd like to hear more from me. Or if you're interested in the video game aspect, I've made more than a few <a href=\"/game-trailer-voice\" title=\"Game Trailer Voiceover\">video game trailers</a>.</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rsUbF9L5oA8","title":"GoTo Malta Explainer Video","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-card","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/go-to-malta-explainer-voice.jpg","alt":"go-to-malta-explainer-voice","className":"blog-post-img"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-caption","children":"GoTo Malta Explainer Video"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>A Little More About GoTo Malta</h2>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://gotoglobal.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"GoTo Malta\">GoTo Malta</a> is part of a larger company called GoTo Global. This is a vehicle rental subscription service that has been designed to make it as easy as possible for people to find and use rental vehicles in Malta. Whether you need the use of an electric scooter, a bike, a moped, or a car, GoTo Malta has you covered. You can simply use the GoTo app to find the nearest vehicle to your location. Everything is sorted on the app, giving you as much freedom and flexibility as possible. </p>"}}]]}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"blog-post-section ","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"you work"}}],null]}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Work With Me</h2>\r\n<p>Are you working on a project similar to this GoTo Malta explainer video? Do you need an experienced voiceover artist to help bring your <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">TV ad</a> or <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a> to the next level? Well I am always happy to hear from new companies, so don't hesitate to <a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Contact Guy\">reach out</a>. I am more than happy to provide you with a free voiceover sample from your script to help you feel certain I'm perfect for your particular project. I can also usually provide my voiceover files on the same day it is requested, which is great for very sensitive deadlines!</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"GoTo Malta Explainer Video","pageUrl":"go-to-malta-explainer-voice"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","860",{"href":"/nakd-bars-mind-blown-professor-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/naked-bars-mind-blown-professor-voice.jpg","alt":"naked-bars-mind-blown-professor-voice","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Nakd Bars - Professor Voice"}]]}],["$","$L3","992",{"href":"/the-most-challenging-voiceover-job","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/the-most-challenging-voiceover-job.webp","alt":"The Most Challenging Voiceover Job - Guy Harris","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"The Most Challenging Voiceover Job!"}]]}],["$","$L3